  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 2,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 2,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Hey, I'm Martin Donadieu,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 4,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "In July 2021, I left "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 22
          },
          "url": "https://naas.ai/",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 4,
                "column": 23
              },
              "text": "Naas"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 46
          },
          "text": " the startup I cofounded in 2019 to build project in solo."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 6,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 6,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "During the first 6 months of my solo journey I focused on rebooting my project Captime, a mobile app I did 4 years earlier, who became a side business with the covid."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 9,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 9,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "In December 2021, While I was rebuilding the app from zero, I got some issue with the current production version,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 11,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 11,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "and things got messy, i had to fix it, but I wanted to avoid releasing a new version, so I searched for a solution to push code updates to my app."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 13,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 13,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "At the time, Captime was making $400/month, so I was looking for an affordable solution, Ionic Appflow was out of my budget."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 15,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 15,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "The only other alternative was Microsoft App Center, but they shut down support for apps running on Cordova / Capacitor."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 17,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 17,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "If you are a solo developer like me, you will find that Ionic AppFlow is not the best Price for you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 19,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 19,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Like you, I was complaining about it, I contacted Ionic, they understood the complaint, but there weren't open to change the pricing, i wasn't the target."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 21,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 21,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "So, I decided to try to fix my biggest pain in my Capacitor JS development workflow: Live updates."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 23,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 23,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "After one month of trying, I found a way to download from one URL a zip and replace the source of the app."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 25,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 25,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "I shared about it and got huge interest on GitHub."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 27,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 27,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "That was too manual for most teams, so they asked for a paid service, that was where I started to work on Capgo as AppFlow alternative."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 29,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 29,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "The goal was to provide a simple and easy to use solution to push code updates to Capacitor JavaScript apps."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 31,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "At launch, it was just live updates - no native builds, no big toolbox like Ionic. Just solving the problem they didn't address for makers like us. (Since then, we've added "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 174
          },
          "url": "/docs/builder/getting-started/",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 31,
                "column": 175
              },
              "text": "Cloud Build"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 31,
            "column": 219
          },
          "text": " for native iOS/Android builds!)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 33,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 33,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "I contacted them to share with them what I was doing, and we found a business friendship agreement."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 35,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 35,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "I build for the maker, they build for the business that need CI/CD and dedicated support :)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 37,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 37,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "You are welcome to join the community to build together, I use it for my projects too, and even I expect this to become my main project in the future."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 39,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 39,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Keep going from How Capgo is born"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 41,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
